            "reviewBody": "We switched to Rankin after spending hundreds on mediocre service. Rankin has exceeded our expectations! They are communicative, passionate about their business and keeping it, and local! I love that they now provide trash cans! Give them a text or call, I promise you'll get an answer for every question!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "author": { "@type": "Person", "name": "Buffy Nehring" },
            "reviewRating": { "@type": "Rating", "ratingValue": "5", "bestRating": "5" },
            "reviewBody": "They are a family owned business. They are always on time for pickup. They provide amazing customer service. They have quick response should you have questions. They treat you like family not just another account. They have great pricing. I highly recommend them."
          }
        ]
      },
      "areaServed": [
        {
          "@type": "City",
          "name": "Hubbard, TX",
          "containedInPlace": { "@type": "State", "name": "Texas" }
        },
        { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "Hill County, TX" },
        { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "McLennan County, TX" },
        { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "Navarro County, TX" },
        { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "Limestone County, TX" },
        { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "Bosque County, TX" }
      ],
      "hasOfferCatalog": {
        "@type": "OfferCatalog",
        "name": "Residential Dumpster Service in Hubbard",
        "itemListElement": SIZES.map((s) => ({
          "@type": "Offer",
          "price": s.price.toFixed(2),
          "priceCurrency": "USD",
          "priceSpecification": {
            "@type": "PriceSpecification",
            "price": s.price.toFixed(2),
            "priceCurrency": "USD",
            "valueAddedTaxIncluded": false
          },
          "itemOffered": {
            "@type": "Service",
            "name": `Weekly ${s.yards}-Yard Residential Dumpster in Hubbard`,
            "description": `A ${s.yards} cubic yard dumpster (about ${s.carts} standard trash carts of capacity) that stays at your home and is emptied once a week on a set schedule. No contracts and no cancellation fees.`,
            "areaServed": { "@type": "City", "name": "Hubbard" },
            "provider": { "@id": "https://rankinwaste.com/#business" }
          }
        }))
      }
    })} />

    <script is:inline type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://rankinwaste.com/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Dump Trailer Rental Service in Hubbard", "item": "https://rankinwaste.com/dumpster-rental-service-hubbard" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Weekly Residential Dumpster Service in Hubbard", "item": PAGE_URL }
      ]
    })} />

    {/* FAQPage schema: generated from the same FAQS array the accordion renders. */}
    <script is:inline type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": FAQS.map((f) => ({
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": f.q,
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": f.a }
      }))
    })} />
  </Fragment>

  <InnerHero
    title="Weekly Residential Dumpster Service in Hubbard"
    subtitle="Serving Hubbard, Hill County, McLennan County, Navarro County, Limestone County & Bosque County, TX"
  />

  <section class="px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-[clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem)] py-12 md:py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-[1300px] mx-auto">

      {/* Intro */}
      <div data-reveal class="mb-14 md:mb-20 max-w-[900px] mx-auto text-center">
        <span class="inline-block mb-5 rounded-full bg-orange-500/15 border border-orange-500/40 px-4 py-1.5 text-orange-300 text-sm font-semibold">
          New: Available Now
        </span>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4 md:mb-6">
          If your trash cart is overflowing, a weekly residential dumpster in Hubbard fixes that for good. Rankin Waste Management now places a 2-, 3-, 4-, or 6-yard dumpster right at your home and empties it every week, so you have room for everything a busy household throws out. And it's not just Hubbard: we bring weekly dumpsters to homes across Hill, McLennan, Navarro, Limestone, and Bosque counties, from Hillsboro and Whitney to Axtell, Dawson, and Prairie Hill. No hauling bags to the road, no lids that won't close, and no stacking extra bags beside the can hoping they get picked up.
        </p>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          It's part of our <a href="/dumpster-rental-service-hubbard" class="text-orange-500 hover:text-orange-300 underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors duration-300">dumpster rental service in Hubbard</a>, built for everyday household trash instead of a one-time project. You still get a real person when you call, there's still no contract to sign, and your pickup still runs on a set weekly schedule. Below you'll find who this service fits best, how it works, which dumpster size is right for your home, and answers to the questions we hear most.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Signs you need it */}
      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.1" class="mb-16 md:mb-24">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 md:mb-6">Signs Your Hubbard Home Has Outgrown a Trash Cart</h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 md:mb-8 max-w-[900px]">
          Plenty of households do fine with a regular cart. But a lot of homes around Hubbard don't fit that mold. Here's when a weekly dumpster starts to make real sense:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-6">
          {SIGNS.map((sign) => (
            <div class="bg-dark-elevated border border-border-subtle rounded-xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">{sign.title}</h3>
              <p class="text-text-muted text-base leading-relaxed">{sign.body}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* How it works */}
      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.1" class="mb-16 md:mb-24">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 md:mb-6">How Weekly Dumpster Service Works</h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 md:mb-8 max-w-[900px]">
          Weekly dumpster service works in three simple steps: you call, we set the dumpster at your home, and we empty it on the same day every week.
        </p>
        <ol class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-6">
          {STEPS.map((step, i) => (
            <li class="bg-dark-elevated border border-border-subtle rounded-xl p-6">
              <span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500 text-white font-bold mb-4" aria-hidden="true">{i + 1}</span>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">{step.title}</h3>
              <p class="text-text-muted text-base leading-relaxed">{step.body}</p>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </div>

      {/* Size / spec block (mirrors "Dump Trailer Sizes We Offer") */}
      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.1" class="mb-16 md:mb-24 max-w-[1100px] mx-auto">
        <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 md:mb-6">Our Residential Dumpster Sizes</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 md:mb-8">
            We offer four sizes so you can match the dumpster to how much trash your home really makes. The 2-yard is the sweet spot for most homes: it holds far more than a cart but still fits beside a driveway or garage without taking over the yard. If your household needs more room, step up to a 3-, 4-, or 6-yard. Not sure which one? Call us and we'll help you pick.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-6 mb-10 md:mb-14">
          {SIZES.map((s) => (
            <div class="bg-dark-elevated border border-border-subtle rounded-xl p-6 md:p-7">
              <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold mb-3 md:mb-4">{s.yards}-Yard Dumpster at a Glance</h3>
              <ul class="text-text-muted text-base leading-relaxed space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 marker:text-orange-500">
                <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">Capacity:</span> {s.yards} cubic yards (about {s.gallons} gallons)</li>
                <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">Price:</span> <span class="font-semibold text-orange-300">${s.price} + tax</span></li>
                <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">Style:</span> Comes with a lid to keep trash covered between pickups</li>
                <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">Fits:</span> {s.fits}</li>
                <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">Cart equivalent:</span> About {s.carts} standard 96-gallon trash carts</li>
                <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">Pickup:</span> Emptied once a week on your scheduled day</li>
                <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">Contract:</span> None. Adjust or cancel anytime</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto">

        <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold mb-3 md:mb-4">What Goes In, and What Stays Out</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-6 mb-6">
          <div class="bg-dark-elevated border border-border-subtle rounded-xl p-6">
            <p class="font-bold text-white mb-3">Good to go</p>
            <ul class="text-text-muted text-base leading-relaxed space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-5 marker:text-orange-500">
              <li>Bagged household trash</li>
              <li>Bagged kitchen and food waste</li>
              <li>Broken-down cardboard boxes</li>
              <li>Bagged leaves and grass clippings</li>
              <li>Small broken household items</li>
              <li>Light debris from small home projects</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-dark-elevated border border-border-subtle rounded-xl p-6">
            <p class="font-bold text-white mb-3">Not allowed under Texas law</p>
            <ul class="text-text-muted text-base leading-relaxed space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-5 marker:text-orange-500">
              <li>Car and truck batteries</li>
              <li>Used motor oil</li>
              <li>Used oil filters</li>
              <li>Whole tires</li>
              <li>Refrigerators, freezers, and AC units that still have refrigerant in them</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4 md:mb-6">
          Those items come straight from the <a href="https://www.law.cornell.edu/regulations/texas/30-Tex-Admin-Code-SS-330-15" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-orange-500 hover:text-orange-300 underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors duration-300">Texas landfill disposal rules</a>, which ban them from regular trash everywhere in the state, not just in our dumpsters.
        </p>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Paint, pesticides, and harsh cleaners need special handling too. The EPA's guide to <a href="https://www.epa.gov/hw/household-hazardous-waste-hhw" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-orange-500 hover:text-orange-300 underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors duration-300">safely disposing of household hazardous waste</a> explains why. If you're not sure about something, give us a call before you toss it.
        </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Dumpster vs. dump trailer */}
      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.1" class="mb-16 md:mb-24 max-w-[900px] mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 md:mb-6">Weekly Dumpster or Dump Trailer: Which One Do You Need?</h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 md:mb-8">
          Pick the weekly dumpster if your home makes more trash than a cart can hold, every single week. Pick a dump trailer if you have one big job, like a garage cleanout or a remodel, and want it gone in a few days.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-6 mb-6 md:mb-8">
          <div class="bg-dark-elevated border border-orange-500 rounded-xl p-6">
            <p class="text-orange-300 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Ongoing</p>
            <p class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Weekly Dumpster</p>
            <ul class="text-text-muted text-base leading-relaxed space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-5 marker:text-orange-500">
              <li>Stays at your home long term</li>
              <li>Emptied every week</li>
              <li>Built for everyday household trash</li>
              <li>2, 3, 4, or 6 cubic yards</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-dark-elevated border border-border-subtle rounded-xl p-6">
            <p class="text-text-muted text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">One-time project</p>
            <p class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">14-Yard Dump Trailer</p>
            <ul class="text-text-muted text-base leading-relaxed space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-5 marker:text-orange-500">
              <li>Drops off for a project, starting at 3 days</li>
              <li>Hauled away when the job is done</li>
              <li>Built for cleanouts, remodels, and yard work</li>
              <li>About 14 cubic yards</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Got a one-time project instead? Our <a href="/dumpster-rental-service-hubbard" class="text-orange-500 hover:text-orange-300 underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors duration-300">14-yard dump trailer rentals</a> are made for exactly that. And if a regular cart is plenty for your house, our <a href="/garbage-collection-service-hubbard" class="text-orange-500 hover:text-orange-300 underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors duration-300">weekly curbside garbage collection</a> is the simpler option.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Pricing (see the PRICING note on SIZES: no billing period stated) */}
      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.1" class="mb-16 md:mb-24 max-w-[900px] mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 md:mb-6">How Much Does a Weekly Dumpster Cost in Hubbard?</h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 md:mb-8">
          A weekly residential dumpster in Hubbard starts at ${STARTING_PRICE} + tax for a 2-yard. Here's our pricing by size:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 md:gap-4 mb-6 md:mb-8">
          {SIZES.map((s) => (
            <div class="bg-dark-elevated border border-border-subtle rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5 text-center">
              <p class="text-text-muted text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">{s.yards}-Yard</p>
              <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white">${s.price}</p>
              <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">+ tax</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4 md:mb-6">
          Call us at <a href={PHONE_LINK} class="text-orange-500 hover:text-orange-300 font-semibold transition-colors duration-300">{PHONE}</a> to confirm the rate and billing schedule for your address, so you know exactly what you'll pay before we ever drop the dumpster off.
